⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
308 calories 30g protein (for the entire pint, toppings included) 😋🤤
Milk and Cookies Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 100 recipes like this one!

- 400g Fat Free High Protein Milk
- 40-45g @Lakanto Monk Fruit sweetener
- 5g (1 tsp) vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- 1g (¼ tsp) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
½ of a package of the @Fuul Snacks Chocolate Chip Cookie Dough bites
2 @OREO Thins (cream removed)
308 calories 35g C, 5g F, 30g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Scrape down the sides of the pint with a butter knife
5. Spin on “Respin” setting (if not, move on to step 6)
6. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the Oreos
7. Run the “Mix-in” cycle
8. Top with the cookie dough bites

